A standalone Rust library providing checked unsigned addition.

## Usage

Add this package from your local checkout or its repository. Registry packages have not been published.

```rust
assert_eq!({{ crate_name }}::add(20, 22), Some(42));
assert_eq!({{ crate_name }}::add(u64::MAX, 1), None);
```

`add` returns `None` when the sum exceeds `u64::MAX`. It performs no I/O and has no runtime dependencies.

Contributor checks and release constraints live in [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md). The manual release workflow prepares a crate archive in a draft GitHub release; publishing to a package registry is a separate owner action.

